  tasks: [
    "Write a python function add_digits(n) that repeatedly adds digits until single digit",
    "Write a python function isomorphic(s, t) that checks if two strings are isomorphic",
    "Write a python function contains_duplicate(lst) that returns True if any duplicate exists",
    "Write a python function move_zeroes(lst) that moves all zeroes to end in place",
    "Write a python function find_duplicate(lst) that finds duplicate number in array",
    "Write a python function product_except_self(lst) that returns products of all except self",
    "Write a python function increasing_triplet(lst) that returns True if increasing triplet exists",
    "Write a python function summary_ranges(lst) that returns summary of consecutive ranges",
    "Write a python function majority_element(lst) that finds element appearing more than n/2 times",
    "Write a python function rotate_array(lst, k) that rotates array k steps to the right",
    "Write a python function search_2d_matrix(matrix, target) that searches sorted 2D matrix",
    "Write a python function set_matrix_zeroes(matrix) that sets row and col to zero if element is zero",
    "Write a python function game_of_life(board) that computes one step of Conway's game of life",
    "Write a python function minimum_size_subarray(target, lst) that finds minimum length subarray with sum >= target",
    "Write a python function longest_substring_no_repeat(s) that finds longest substring without repeating chars",
    "Write a python function find_all_anagrams(s, p) that finds all anagram positions of p in s",
    "Write a python function repeated_dna(s) that finds all repeated 10-letter DNA sequences",
    "Write a python function bulls_and_cows(secret, guess) that returns bulls and cows count",
    "Write a python function nth_digit(n) that finds nth digit in infinite integer sequence",
    "Write a python function rectangle_area(ax1, ay1, ax2, ay2, bx1, by1, bx2, by2) that computes total area of two rectangles"
